# ==============================================================================
# Pixcell Backend Environment Variables
# ==============================================================================
# Instructions:
# 1. Duplicate this file and rename it to `.env`
# 2. Follow the step-by-step guides below to retrieve/generate each required key
# 3. For production deployments (e.g. Hugging Face Spaces, Docker, VPS),
#    add these variables to your hosting environment secrets.

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. GOOGLE GEMINI API KEY
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# HOW TO GET:
# 1. Visit Google AI Studio: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
# 2. Sign in with your Google account.
# 3. Click "Create API Key" (or select an existing Google Cloud project).
# 4. Copy the generated API key (starts with `AIzaSy...`).
# 5. If regenerating an old key: You can delete the previous key or generate a new one
#    from the same dashboard.
#
# PURPOSE:
# Used by backend/llm.py to generate diagnostic pathology summaries and clinical
# recommendations from microscopic cell detection counts.
GEMINI_API_KEY="AIzaSyYourGeminiApiKeyHere"
